    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>This is absolutely one of the defining features of Beavis and Butt-Head, especially in its original run. The duo&#x27;s crude, simplistic, and often hilarious commentary on music videos was a groundbreaking and highly popular aspect of the show.</Text>
